@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Practice exam: Exam.IsMock = true, same exam window and save/submit endpoints as a real exam
' (ExamDashboard.PracticeButton_OnClick, ExamsController.GetPracticeExams / StartSession,
' SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync, StudentPortalController and AnalyticsService leave IsMock out)
' Print sizing (D6): large font at dpi 96, so PlantUML's fixed pixel gaps stay small next to the text;
' printed size = 22 * (printed width in pt) / (PNG width px), at least 7 pt at the width used in Chapter 5.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}

|Desktop App|
start
:GET /api/exams/student/practice,\npick a practice exam, press Practice:\nPOST /api/exams/{id}/start-session;
|Server|
if (Eligible, open, seat OK,
readiness (if required)?) then ([yes])
  :Running attempt or
  a new ExamSession;
else ([no])
  :400/403 with a message
  (EXAM_NOT_STARTED,
  SEAT_MISMATCH,
  READINESS_REQUIRED);
  |Desktop App|
  :Show message box;
  stop
endif
|Desktop App|
:Start monitoring (no webcam),
open ExamWindow in Report
lockdown (apps only reported);
:Answer, auto-save via
save-answer, then POST
submit (see submission flow);
|Server|
:FinalizeAsync: receipt; auto-marked
if AI evaluation on; no plagiarism
check; left out of the student's
results and analytics;
|Desktop App|
:Show the receipt (no mark),
attempt count + 1;
stop
@enduml
